    {
      "title": "Tamil Nadu govt inks 97 MoUs for commitment of over ₹67,000 crore",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/india-news/tamil-nadu-govt-inks-97-mous-for-commitment-of-over-67-000-crore-126081300698_1.html",
      "description": "The Tamil Nadu government inked 97 fresh MoUs for a total commitment of over Rs 67,000 crore, in the presence of Chief Minister C Joseph Vijay here on Thursday.\nThe MoUs were exchanged at the TVK government's first \"Vettri Tamil Nadu Investors Conclave 2026\", marking a major investment milestone since the Tamilaga Vettri Kazhagam formed the government in May.\nThe pacts signed also in the presence of Industries Minister S Keerthana would create employment opportunities for more than one lakh people across sectors, including automotive, renewables and life science, electronics, R&amp;D and data centre.",
